                   "企劃/專案執行",
                   "代表專案"
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-08-05T23:04:01+08:00",
            "date_modified": "2026-09-03T13:00:56+08:00"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/yue-jin-gang-deng-jie.html",
            "url": "https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/yue-jin-gang-deng-jie.html",
            "title": "月津港燈節｜ 專案合作與執行",
            "summary": "◆ 專案時間：2024.12 ~ 2025.1 ◆ 專案名稱：2025 月津港燈節 ◆ 專案地點：台南鹽水 ◆ 角色：提案企劃／作品製作／現場執行 #&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>◆ 專案時間：2024.12 ~ 2025.1  ◆ 專案名稱：2025 月津港燈節  <br>◆ 專案地點：台南鹽水               ◆ 角色：提案企劃／作品製作／現場執行<br><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"># 提案企劃 # 現場執行 # </span><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d; font-size: inherit;\">時程控管</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"> </span>_____________________________________________________________________________________</p>\n<p><strong>背景與目標：<br></strong><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">參與臺南市政府文化局主辦之「2025 月津港燈節－月津超新星」徵選，希望作品能入選並將創作概念轉化為符合預算、戶外展演條件與時程需求的實際作品。</span><strong><br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>負責內容</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>提案企劃撰寫並徵件入圍</strong><br>撰寫徵件企畫書通過初、複選評選，作品獲選於 2025 台南月津港燈節展出。\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #264b6f;\"><strong data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1101\">提案目標</strong></span><br data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1104\"><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\">以 BB Call 與數字傳訊文化為出發點，回應月津港燈節的徵件需求，發展能讓觀眾直接參與的互動裝置</span>。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #264b6f;\"><strong data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1165\">體驗設計</strong></span><br data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1168\"><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\">我們沒有只呈現 BB Call 的外觀，而是讓觀眾實際輸入數字密碼，透過互動重新經歷過去以數字傳遞情感的方式。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><span style=\"color: #264b6f;\"><strong data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1233\">執行考量</strong></span><br data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1236\">作品需長時間於戶外展出，因此在提案進入製作後，也必須同步考量大量製作、防水、電路穩定及現場維護。<br><br></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>大量製作下的時間控管</strong><br>負責燈箱設計與製作，兼顧造型、防水結構、電路配置及測試，與5位同學花1個月的時間完成 98 組燈箱製作，在兼顧多項專案與課業的情況下，如期完成大規模製作與展覽執行。<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>團隊協作與現場執行</strong><br>參與作品布展與現場執行，與團隊共7人合作完成作品安裝、調整及展場建置，確保展覽順利展出，完成大型展覽作品製作與展出。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>展出成果與社群觸及</strong></span><br><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">提案獲選並實際完成製作展出；</span>展出期間不但獲得民眾自發分享與討論，<span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">工作室</span>社群（Instagram、Threads）單篇貼文觸及約 3,000 人次。</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/IMG_0259.jpg\" data-size=\"1477x1108\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/IMG_0259-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/IMG_9572.jpg\" data-size=\"2364x1774\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/IMG_9572-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/IMG_2360-2.jpg\" data-size=\"2364x1433\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/IMG_2360-2-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"466\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p><strong> </strong>社群觸及：</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image post__image--center\">   <img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/S__33021958_0-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"245\" height=\"392\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/responsive/S__33021958_0-2-xs.jpg 300w ,https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/responsive/S__33021958_0-2-sm.jpg 480w ,https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/responsive/S__33021958_0-2-md.jpg 768w ,https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/responsive/S__33021958_0-2-lg.jpg 1024w\"></figure>\n<p>以下為實際參與徵件時之企劃書內容節錄：</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/900MHz-Fu-Shen-Xiu-Zheng-Ji-Hua-Shu_page-0004.jpg\" data-size=\"1241x1755\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/900MHz-Fu-Shen-Xiu-Zheng-Ji-Hua-Shu_page-0004-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1086\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/900MHz-Fu-Shen-Xiu-Zheng-Ji-Hua-Shu_page-0005.jpg\" data-size=\"1241x1755\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/900MHz-Fu-Shen-Xiu-Zheng-Ji-Hua-Shu_page-0005-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1086\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/900MHz-Fu-Shen-Xiu-Zheng-Ji-Hua-Shu_page-0006.jpg\" data-size=\"1241x1755\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/900MHz-Fu-Shen-Xiu-Zheng-Ji-Hua-Shu_page-0006-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1086\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/900MHz-Fu-Shen-Xiu-Zheng-Ji-Hua-Shu_page-0008.jpg\" data-size=\"1241x1755\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/900MHz-Fu-Shen-Xiu-Zheng-Ji-Hua-Shu_page-0008-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1086\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/900MHz-Fu-Shen-Xiu-Zheng-Ji-Hua-Shu_page-0009.jpg\" data-size=\"1241x1755\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/900MHz-Fu-Shen-Xiu-Zheng-Ji-Hua-Shu_page-0009-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1086\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/900MHz-Fu-Shen-Xiu-Zheng-Ji-Hua-Shu_page-0010.jpg\" data-size=\"1241x1755\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/gallery/900MHz-Fu-Shen-Xiu-Zheng-Ji-Hua-Shu_page-0010-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1086\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/11mv7YtbQOVbRbbLO3B3op7Vy3_tt-x7L/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">&gt; 完整企劃書內容連結</a></p>\n<p><strong>作品創作：</strong><br>「 900MHz 」；裝置作品<br><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">共同創作者：林俊遑、黃紀虹、陳苡瑄、陳懿、蔡承嶧、戴婕茵</span></p>\n<p class=\"cvGsUA block-font-kerning-none block-font-feature-liga-off block-font-feature-clig-off block-font-feature-calt-off direction-ltr align-justify para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">還記得用BB call 的年代嗎?<br></span><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">那時人們人手一台Call機，以900MHz頻率聯繫彼此，螢幕上的數字不僅能傳遞簡單訊息，也創造出特有的傳訊文化。<br></span><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">如今人與人的聯繫變得更便捷，卻少了當初的珍貴。我們希望能透過此作品帶您回到1990年代，重拾數字傳情的溫馨回憶。<br></span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">螢幕上的數字閃爍著，邀請您透過有趣的諧音密碼，重溫傳訊的感動。</span></p>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"690\" height=\"386\" style=\"width: 690px; height: 386px;\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xhtPHDEM6ws?si=gy_f7ilGyEsfbEUl\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe>作品紀錄｜林俊遑</figure>",
            "image": "https://YUNCHUN1004.github.io/media/posts/3/FD01414D-3C8A-40C7-823B-3666AEE02451_L0_001-2025_1_21-Xia-Wu-5_20_54.jpg",
